}) %>```

<%= it.variant({
  "claude-code": "The ⇄ is revocation: a question raised later by a peer's plan can drop an approved planner back into the revision loop.\n",
  codex: "`APPROVED` is sticky-but-revocable: a question raised later by a peer's plan can drop an approved planner back into the revision loop. A planner that holds approval and is not revising has nothing more to send — that is what \"done\" looks like.\n",
  opencode: "`APPROVED` is sticky-but-revocable: a question raised later by a peer's plan can drop an approved planner back into the revision loop. A planner that holds approval and is not revising has nothing more to send — that is what \"done\" looks like.\n",
